  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Added standard Cyphal well-known port IDs (Heartbeat=7509, GetInfo=430, ExecuteCommand=435).\n\t\t\t- Structured error handling with graceful degradation and central diagnostics counters.\n\t\t\t- Introduced a dependency-free ILogger abstraction for diagnostics output.\n\t\t\t- Improved NuGet packaging and build targets for DSDL content delivery.\n\t\t\t- Expanded XML documentation coverage across the public API.",
